{"name": "World of Slime", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/06a447f415d7384d49b33e8027243a86.webp?t=1787735051\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/06a447f415d7384d49b33e8027243a86.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>One day, mutant slimes suddenly appeared before mankind!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras_big/0495bc4c56bee5038407814de7d31157.avif?t=1787735051\" height=\"504\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/0495bc4c56bee5038407814de7d31157.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World of Slime</strong> is a casual adventure MMORPG where you explore with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture and synthesize chewy, gooey slimes to discover new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure with your partner slime as you hunt other slimes and overcome obstacles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">solve problems for slimes and various NPCs, and slowly uncover the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/06f5add6ad068dadd24fc033d8134fcb.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/852c8590ab05ed32c3795ad8d2c721ac.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/852c8590ab05ed32c3795ad8d2c721ac.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/852c8590ab05ed32c3795ad8d2c721ac.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">People in the World of Slime have gathered in villages to stay safe from the wild slimes that suddenly appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can help people using their special power to capture slimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special slimes that have formed a bond with you can move as you wish or help clear obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a7b721f794403dc93c10f3c3c4e4e08d.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a2397e2d943724811c90f64f196b10be.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a2397e2d943724811c90f64f196b10be.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a2397e2d943724811c90f64f196b10be.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Record the new slimes you meet on your adventure in your Slimepedia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you capture more slimes or strengthen your bonds to build knowledge,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you can learn skills that make your adventure easier or unlock stronger hidden functions within your slimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Studying slimes is just as important as leveling them up, so keep exploring their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/02bd97c188742f0a3d35c9264216eb57.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/664a1d7854ff7b5def84601fc814d7c5.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/664a1d7854ff7b5def84601fc814d7c5.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/664a1d7854ff7b5def84601fc814d7c5.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different locations in the World of Slime with your slime companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride a slime to swim or have one pull a sled to reach places you could never get to on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt powerful slimes hiding deep within the world, or capture them and make them your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you help the various NPCs you meet on your journey, the secrets of the world will slowly be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/25cc8f82bf6d81d8831f685f78a0a4a1.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/96c87255525ad61bf72cba731405f305.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/96c87255525ad61bf72cba731405f305.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/96c87255525ad61bf72cba731405f305.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make new friends in the World of Slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this cute world together and share information with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create stronger, more unique parties and claim victory in 1v1 or team PvP battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/76681bccc91aeb121666ce43c6ece487.webp?t=1787735051\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"486\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/76681bccc91aeb121666ce43c6ece487.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "World of Slime is a casual MMORPG where you capture, collect, and grow with all kinds of slimes. Find new slimes through field capture, synthesis, and fishing, then take them with you into battles, exploration, and puzzles.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/29175c5839e0fea809545ca50f7165a6fd03a196/header.jpg?t=1787735051", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Casual", "MMORPG", "Creature Collector", "Massively Multiplayer", "Adventure"], "developers": "TEAM42", "publishers": "TEAM42", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4671450", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/DcGavHFwqtk", "first_seen": 1787695200.0, "review_rank": 55}